    kg:textSpan "is almost no barrier to comprehend the images, ask proper questions about the visual objects, and give correct answers. However, medical images such as pathology images are highly domain-specic, which can only be interpreted by well-educated medical professionals. It is very difcult and expensive to hire medical professionals to help create medical VQA datasets. Second, to create a VQA dataset, one rst needs to collect an image dataset. While images in the general domain are pervasive, medical i" .

