    kg:textSpan "worth noting that for passive sentences with a structure of be+shown/presented/demonstrated\", we keep their original forms rather than performing 5 A PREPRINT M ARCH 24, 2020 Microscopy shows coagulative necrosis of the affected bowel wall and thrombosed vessels. Answer phrases Subject-auxiliary inversion Does microscopy show coagulative necrosis of the affected bowel wall and thrombosed vessels. Answer phrases Insert question phrases What does microscopy show of the affected bowel wall and thro" .

