    kg:textSpan "general-domain corpora, they may not be able to effectively capture the semantics relevant to pathology. To improve, we can pre-train the word embeddings on medical literature, such as medical textbooks, clinical guidelines, medical publications, etc. 6 Conclusion and Future Works In this paper, towards the goal of developing AI systems to pass the board-certicated examinations of the American Board of Pathology and fostering research in medical visual question answering, we build a pathology VQ" .

