    kg:textSpan "curating data using NST is expensive, costing us over 10 thousand GPU hours. Finally, our method can sometimes produce slightly desaturated, less vibrant images compared to other approaches. While weve demonstrated this does not lead to worse image quality or downstream performance it is unclear what is causing this qualitative defect. R EFERENCES [1] G. N. Gunesli, M. Bilal, S. E. A. Raza, and N. M. Rajpoot, A federated learning approach to tumor detection in colon histology images, Journal of " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2403_11340_rag__chunk_005> a kg:Chunk ;
