    kg:textSpan "network (GPFM). Baselines. To evaluate the performance of our FM, GPFM, we conducted a comprehensive evaluation by comparing it with other vision FMs, namely Ctranspath [ 37 ], Phikon [ 32 ], and UNI [ 33 ], slide-level FM CHIEF [ 64 ] and ProvGigapath [ 56 ], as well as visual-language FMs PLIP [ 36 ] and CONCH [ 35 ]. As a baseline, we also compared these FMs with a ResNet50 [ 65 ] pretrained on the ImageNet dataset [ 66 ]. The model configurations and training details for all these models are" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_18449_rag__chunk_023> a kg:Chunk ;
