    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2408_15218_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "LDM operates within a compressed latent space, enabling di ff usion models to scale e ffi ciently and produce highresolution images with less computational overhead while still delivering remarkable image quality. On this foundation, the Concurrently, GANs were also being applied to image superresolution tasks, with SRGAN Ledig et al. (2017b) becoming Fig. 3: Generated super-resolution images using GAN-based methods. These methods struggle to preserve stain color in histopathology images. The zo" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2408_15218_rag__chunk_009> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "2408.15218_rag::chunk_009" ;
    kg:docId "2408.15218_rag" ;
