    kg:textSpan "PathInsight: Instruction Tuning of Multimodal Datasets and Models for Intelligence Assisted Diagnosis in Histopathology Xiaomin Wu 1 , Rui Xu 1 , Pengchen Wei 1 , Wenkang Qin 1 , Peixiang Huang 1 , Ziheng Li 1 , and Lin Luo 1 arXiv:2408.07037v1 [cs.CV] 13 Aug 2024 1 College of Engineering, Peking University, Beijing, China Abstract. Pathological diagnosis remains the definitive standard for identifying tumors. The rise of multimodal large models has simplified the process of integrating image an" .

