    kg:textSpan "including GPT-4o (OpenAI, 2024), Grok-3 (xAI, 2025), GPT-o3 (OpenAI, 2025), Gemini-2.5-pro (Team et al., 2023), Deepseek-R1 (DeepSeek-AI, 2025), and Mistral Medium 3 (Mistral AI, 2024). The results in 16-shot settings on TCGA-NSCLC are represented in Table 8. The experimental results demonstrated that MGPATH(PLIP-G) consistently exceeded the baseline across all text prompt sources. The model achieved the best performance with Mistral Medium 3 (Mistral AI, 2024), which produced the highest AUC (9" .

