    kg:textSpan "PolyPath : Adapting a Large Multimodal Model for Multi-slide Pathology Report Generation Faruk Ahmed , Lin Yang, Tiam Jaroensri, Andrew Sellergren, Yossi Matias, Avinatan Hassidim, Greg S. Corrado, Dale R. Webster, Shravya Shetty, Shruthi Prabhakara, Yun Liu, Daniel Golden , Ellery Wulczyn , and David F. Steiner Google Research arXiv:2502.10536v1 [cs.CV] 14 Feb 2025 Abstract The interpretation of histopathology cases underlies many important diagnostic and treatment decisions in medicine. Notabl" .

