    kg:textSpan "Proceedings of Machine Learning Research Under Review: 1 16 , 2022 Full Paper MIDL 2022 Inference of captions from histopathological patches Masayuki Tsuneki 1 tsuneki@medmain.com Fahdi Kanavati 1 fkanavati@medmain.com 1 Medmain Research, Medmain Inc., 2-4-5-104, Akasaka, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka, 810-0042 Japan Editors: Under Review for MIDL 2022 Abstract Computational histopathology has made significant strides in the past few years, slowly getting closer to clinical adoption. One area of benefit woul" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/9gKn7SDb83v_rag__chunk_005> a kg:Chunk ;
