    :hasEvidenceText "By leveraging deep learning for digital histological staining generation, virtual staining offers an efficient, precise, and cost-effective alternative."^^xsd:string,
        "Virtual staining [ 4 , 16 , 17 , 47 , 50 ], powered by deep learning, provides a rapid and cost-effective alternative to manual"^^xsd:string,
        "Virtual staining [ 4 , 16 , 17 , 47 , 50 ], powered by deep learning, provides a rapid and cost-effective alternative to manual, labor"^^xsd:string,
        "Virtual staining circumvents the need for laborious sample preparation, specialized laboratory equipment, and technical personnel requirement in traditional chemical histological staining."^^xsd:string,
        "virtual staining in the central region is more reliable and realistic than in the edge areas."^^xsd:string,
        "virtual staining is now being leveraged as a powerful pretext task for representation learning"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Virtual Staining"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A synthesis task where a model generates a stained representation from an image (e.g., a gray image), often used for representation learning or multi-task architectures."^^xsd:string ;
