        "2502.19293_rag::chunk_001"^^xsd:string,
        "2505.10993_rag::chunk_015"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Recent advancements in deep learning have focused on the integration of multiple information modalities, such as images and text [11,12,21,26]. Some of the first vision-language models applied in the pathology domain"^^xsd:string,
        "flexible, generalist VLMs that raise concerns about reliability and consistency"^^xsd:string,
        "integration of multiple information modalities, such as images and text [11,12,21,26]. Some of the first vision-language models applied in the pathology domain"^^xsd:string,
        "vision-language models (VLMs) have gained particular attention for their ability to effectively manage limited annotations and interpret complex whole-slide pathology images."^^xsd:string,
        "vision-language models (VLMs) like PLIP (Huang et al., 2023) (trained 200K image-text pairs), CONCH (Lu et al., 2024) (1.17M), or QUILTNET (Ikezogwo et al., 2024) (1M), integrate visual and textual information"^^xsd:string,
        "vision-language models applied in the pathology domain, including PLIP [7] and CONCH [15], used histopathology images with corresponding captions"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :automatedsystem,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Vision-Language Model"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A model architecture designed to manage limited annotations and interpret complex whole-slide pathology images through the interaction of visual and textual information."^^xsd:string ;
