    kg:textSpan "S PATIA : Multimodal Model for Prediction and Generation of Spatial Cell Phenotypes Zhenglun Kong 1 , Mufan Qiu 2 , John Boesen 1 , Xiang Lin 1 , Sukwon Yun 2 , Tianlong Chen 2 , Manolis Kellis 3 , Marinka Zitnik 1 1 Harvard University, 2 UNC-Chapel Hill, 3 MIT {mufan,swyun,tianlong}@cs.unc.edu , jmboesen@college.harvard.edu, manoli@mit.edu , {zhenglun_kong,xiang_lin,marinka}@hms.harvard.edu arXiv:2507.04704v1 [q-bio.QM] 7 Jul 2025 Abstract Understanding how cellular morphology, gene expression," .

