    kg:textSpan "free-form textual answers by the large language model, solely based on these compressed token representations. This design effectively balances computational efficiency and model expressiveness, ensuring scalability to high-resolution WSIs. The subsequent subsections detail each architectural component, highlighting how they collectively support efficient and effective multimodal learning for pathology applications. Whole Slide Image Text Generation. Early efforts to move beyond classification f" .

