    kg:textSpan "robustness in virtual staining applications. The model uses multi-task diffusion processes to learn conditional image-to-image (I2I) tasks: (a) accurately staining cells for H&E conditioned immunohistochemistry generation (IHC), and (b) simultaneously segmenting the same cells on H&E input image, creating an implicit affinity between the tasks. Leveraging the flexibility of our architecture, we extend it to multiplex staining, enabling the generation of multiple stains on the same H&E image usin" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_18449_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
