    kg:docId "2407.18449_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2407_18449_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "on a limited type and number of tasks, leaving their generalization ability and overall performance unclear. To address this gap, we established a most comprehensive benchmark to evaluate the performance of offthe-shelf foundation models across six distinct clinical task types, encompassing a total of 72 specific tasks, including slide-level classification, survival prediction, ROI-tissue classification, ROI retrieval, visual question answering, and report generation. Our findings reveal that ex" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_18449_rag__chunk_012> a kg:Chunk ;
