    kg:docId "bVunbe4hoV_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/bVunbe4hoV_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "images during training like AR-CycleGAN ( Ke et al. , 2023 ) or manual input by providing localization masks like ArtiFusion ( He et al. , 2023 ) and DDRM ( Kawar et al. , 2022 ). To provide localizations reliably to all models, we leverage the ground truth segmentation masks of the artifacts from Stieber et al. ( 2022 ). We train ArtiFusion and DDRM on the BCSS with the same backbone architecture as our model. [TABLE id=bVunbe4hoV_p6_t1] caption: Table 1: Image quality metrics for the artifact " .

